WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.970
You thought more investment means
higher level of digital transformation.

00:00:04.310 --> 00:00:07.670
While in reality,
much of the budget just burned.

00:00:08.070 --> 00:00:09.950
Every factory runs differently.

00:00:10.970 --> 00:00:13.390
Requirements pour in and keep changing.

00:00:15.380 --> 00:00:17.460
Without a unified data foundation,

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:20.640
digital projects
always start from scratch.

00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:27.980
Expensive, hard to change,
and slow to deliver.

00:00:28.460 --> 00:00:29.460
Seriously?

00:00:29.540 --> 00:00:31.800
And that's not even the worst part.

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:34.000
You think you're buying software once,

00:00:34.060 --> 00:00:36.340
but disconnected systems
force you to pay

00:00:36.340 --> 00:00:38.620
for integration again and again.

00:00:39.180 --> 00:00:40.180
Here's a twist.

00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:44.320
Tier0 breaks that cycle
with unified namespace.

00:00:44.700 --> 00:00:46.580
All systems consume and share data

00:00:46.580 --> 00:00:48.920
from a united real-time namespace.

00:00:49.420 --> 00:00:52.500
Connect and model once,
reuse everywhere.

00:00:53.840 --> 00:00:55.620
Ready to see it in action?

00:00:57.440 --> 00:00:59.840
Let's walk through it, step by step.

00:01:00.080 --> 00:01:01.820
Bring data in, fast.

00:01:01.820 --> 00:01:04.880
Any protocol, any machine, any system.

00:01:05.340 --> 00:01:07.080
Connect it in minutes.

00:01:10.440 --> 00:01:11.980
Give data a shared meaning.

00:01:12.340 --> 00:01:14.960
One semantic structure,
one unified namespace.

00:01:16.420 --> 00:01:18.260
Then route it visually.

00:01:18.540 --> 00:01:20.220
Deliver data where it's needed.

00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:24.680
One source feeds all apps,
no reintegration.

00:01:25.340 --> 00:01:28.880
Now the data is ready,
AI can act on it at scale.

00:01:34.860 --> 00:01:37.800
Turn signals into reusable analysis,

00:01:37.900 --> 00:01:41.420
OEE, downtime, quality, energy, and more.

00:01:48.250 --> 00:01:50.110
Need an app? Just describe it.

00:01:51.150 --> 00:01:53.670
Generate, modify, test, and release

00:01:53.670 --> 00:01:55.310
in hours, not months.

00:02:03.710 --> 00:02:05.970
Visualize machines live in 3D.

00:02:06.290 --> 00:02:08.990
See status, context, and issues instantly.

00:02:12.800 --> 00:02:13.800
Want to scale?

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:17.480
Install proven apps, configure once,
deploy across sites.

00:02:19.880 --> 00:02:23.700
Tier0 is the foundation for
industrial data, software, and AI.

00:02:23.960 --> 00:02:27.980
Build faster, operate at lower cost,
reuse everywhere.

00:02:28.680 --> 00:02:31.260
Turn industrial data into business ROI.
